		<div data-flow="signup" class="astro-6kgpyice">
				<p class="crd__title astro-6kgpyice" id="cloud-signup-title">
					Choose your data region
				</p>
				<p class="crd__lede astro-6kgpyice">
						Your data stays in the region you choose, for residency and compliance. No credit card required.
					</p>

				<div class="crd__regions astro-6kgpyice">
					<a class="crd__region gtm_button astro-6kgpyice" href="https://thingsboard.cloud/signup" id="TryItNow_Cloud_NorthAmerica" data-region="us" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
