</svg>
						</a><a class="crd__region gtm_button astro-6kgpyice" href="https://eu.thingsboard.cloud/signup" id="TryItNow_Cloud_Europe" data-region="eu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
							<span class="crd__globe astro-6kgpyice" style="--region: #0e8aa8">
